                         class="bg-image" alt="Damini Bhir" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2023 AD" data-ne="२०२३ ई.सं.">2023 AD</span>
                        <h4 data-en="Damini Bhir" data-ne="दमिनी भीर">Damini Bhir</h4>
                        <p data-en="Staged at Mandala Theatre in 2023..." data-ne="सन् २०२३ मा मण्डला थिएटरमा मञ्चन भएको...">
                            Staged at Mandala Theatre in 2023, Kiran Chamling Rai handled the responsibility of Music Design and Choreography, showcasing his multifaceted artistic practice.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="damini-bhir" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
