                         class="bg-image" alt="A Search for a Dream" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2064 B.S." data-ne="२०६४ वि.सं.">2064 B.S.</span>
                        <h4 data-en="A Search for a Dream" data-ne="एउटा सपनाको खोजी">A Search for a Dream</h4>
                        <p data-en="A theatrical performance where Kiran Chamling Rai contributed as an actor..."
