                            A theatrical performance where Kiran Chamling Rai contributed as an actor, exploring the depths of human aspirations.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="a-search-for-a-dream" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 4. A Question -->
                <div class="tw-bg-card">
                    <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/aquestion.jpg")"
                         onerror="this.onerror=null; this.src='https://via.placeholder.com/400x250/1a2332/d4af37?text=A+Question';"
                         class="bg-image" alt="A Question" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2064 B.S." data-ne="२०६४ वि.सं.">2064 B.S.</span>
                        <h4 data-en="A Question" data-ne="एउटा प्रश्न">A Question</h4>
                        <p data-en="An acting credit that questions societal norms..." data-ne="एउटा अभिनय क्रेडिट जसले सामाजिक मान्यताहरूलाई प्रश्न गर्दछ...">
                            An acting credit that questions societal norms and explores the complexities of human existence.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="a-question" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 5. Time and Violence -->
                <div class="tw-bg-card">
                    <img src="@Url.Content("~/images/timevoilence.jpg")"
