                         class="bg-image" alt="Time and Violence" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2069 B.S." data-ne="२०६९ वि.सं.">2069 B.S.</span>
                        <h4 data-en="Time and Violence" data-ne="समय र हिंसा">Time and Violence</h4>
                        <p data-en="A play delving into the intricate relationship between the passage of time..."
                           data-ne="समय बित्दै जाँदा र हिंसाको समाजमा पर्ने प्रभावबीचको जटिल सम्बन्ध...">
                            A play delving into the intricate relationship between the passage of time and the impact of violence on society.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="time-and-violence" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 6. Woman (Nari) -->
