                         class="bg-image" alt="Woman" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2069 B.S." data-ne="२०६९ वि.सं.">2069 B.S.</span>
                        <h4 data-en="Woman (Nari)" data-ne="नारी">Woman (Nari)</h4>
                        <p data-en="Performed in around 25 districts across Nepal..." data-ne="नेपालका करिब २५ जिल्लामा प्रदर्शन भएको...">
                            Performed in around 25 districts across Nepal, this play highlights the struggles and resilience of women in society.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="nari" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
