                         class="bg-image" alt="Majipa Lakhey" />
                    <div class="overlay"></div>
                    <div class="tw-bg-content">
                        <span data-en="2070 B.S." data-ne="२०७० वि.सं.">2070 B.S.</span>
                        <h4 data-en="Majipa Lakhey" data-ne="मजिपा लाखे">Majipa Lakhey</h4>
                        <p data-en="A cultural play drawing from Newar traditions and mythology..." data-ne="नेवारी परम्परा र पौराणिक कथाहरूबाट प्रेरित सांस्कृतिक नाटक...">
                            A cultural play drawing from Newar traditions and mythology, bringing the legend of Majipa Lakhey to life.
                        </p>
                        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="PlayDetails" asp-route-id="majipa-lakhey" class="read-more-btn" data-en="READ MORE" data-ne="थप पढ्नुहोस्">थप पढ्नुहोस्</a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 10. Harjeet -->
